Package: PhysioReport
Type: Package
Title: Clinical Report Generation for the x-biosignal Ecosystem
Version: 0.1.1
Authors@R: person("Yusuke", "Matsui", role = c("aut", "cre"), email = "mail.to.matsui@gmail.com")
Description: Parameterized, bilingual (Japanese/English), colorblind-safe clinical
    reports (gait, HRV, EMG) with normative overlays and MDC/MCID-annotated change
    for the x-biosignal physiological signal ecosystem.
